<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alexandria Real Estate initiated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alexandria Real Estate initiated.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>EVEREN Securities said Friday it began coverage with an outperform rating of Alexandria Real Estate Equities Inc, which owns suburban office properties designed and leased as laboratory space for pharmaceutical and life sciences research.</p>
<p>Demand is growing and supply is limited, said analyst Burl East, in a report.</p>
<p>Shares of Alexandria Real Estate were trading up 1/16 to 21-3/4.</p>
<p>			 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
